(text "REVIEW ONLY / OPAQUE COTS USAGE\nAZUR SPACE Solar Power GmbH / 3G30C-Advanced bare cell (8 × 8 cm)\nProduct ID: azur-3g30c-advanced-81780\nPart number: 81780\nRevision: catalog-record-1; product hardware revision not stated\nAllocated roles: solar. One physical usage record. Quantity: 3.\nAccounting boundary: One bare cell only. Mass and dimensions exclude the external bypass diode,\ninterconnects, coverglass, substrate/panel, harness and installation. The 81752 CIC assembly is a\ndifferent product and is excluded.\nSupported catalog configurations (none is automatically chosen):\nOne bare cell, material 81780, drawing ZP-0005107. Array wiring, packaging, bypass diode and\ncoverglass are external design items.\nSources (exact URLs and document revisions also in manifest.json):\n30% Triple-Junction (TJ) III-V Bare Solar Cells & Assemblies, TJ 3G30-Advanced (8x8) / DB\n00010892-01, issue date 2025-04-11\nhttps://www.azurspace.com/media/uploads/file_links/file/bdb_00010892-01-00_tj3g30-advanced_8x8.pdf\nLocation: PDF pp. 1–2. Product identifiers p. 1. Mechanical and typical electrical tables p. 2..\nRetrieved: 2026-10-17\nCatalog caveats:\nEOL fields select the manufacturer table endpoint at 1 × 10^15 1 MeV electrons/cm². This is not a\ncalendar lifetime or a prediction for the demo orbit.\nElectrical values are typical population performance, not guaranteed lower bounds. Mission\ntemperature, shielding, attitude and radiation equivalence need assessment.\nDo not substitute the CIC current column for this bare-cell record.\nMass is an average-weight statement with an upper bound on the average, not a guaranteed\nindividual-cell maximum." (at 25.4 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 808220d0-a031-4d67-8f01-229a9b078671))
